// One DDA step: walk ((import shoot_step) milli-units) further along the shooter's
// facing direction (the same -sin/-cos forward vector as player movement,
// see player/move/vec/fwd.id, but frozen at the yaw the shot was fired at --
// yaw doesn't change mid-flight since this all happens within one frame).
// Split across cast/advance/x.id, z.id and this file: 12 native calls is 4
// times a block's budget.

ray_advance() {
  ray_advance_x();
  ray_advance_z();
  ray_advance_step();
} return void;
